00:04:36.856 --> 00:04:41.116
Britain has approved the Jack-Daw gas field in the North Sea, and the government says homes

00:04:41.116 --> 00:04:43.396
and businesses get that gas from the end of the month.

00:04:43.396 --> 00:04:49.496
Energy Secretary Miata Fonbola said the regulator may grant consent that the field creates 27

00:04:49.496 --> 00:04:55.456
