00:04:56.836 --> 00:05:01.276
Prime Minister Andy Burnham says it protects hundreds of jobs and helps keep millions of homes

00:05:01.276 --> 00:05:04.476
warm, because Britain will still burn oil and gas for decades.

00:05:05.116 --> 00:05:11.636
A Guardian analysis, using government figures, says oil and gas were 75% of UK energy in 2025,

00:05:11.636 --> 00:05:14.716
