00:05:15.356 --> 00:05:18.336
Jack Dawes sits about 150 miles east of Aberdeen.

00:05:18.776 --> 00:05:21.456
Adura operates it, half Equinor and half Shell.

00:05:21.976 --> 00:05:25.976
