00:05:35.956 --> 00:05:39.596
She puts the field at about 2% of gas demand for roughly 10 years.

00:05:39.596 --> 00:05:45.816
Uplift's Tessa Khan says it has been oversold and that new oil and gas fields do not fit safe climate limits.

00:05:46.376 --> 00:05:49.736
Green leader Zach Polansky has called the decision climate vandalism.

00:05:50.276 --> 00:05:54.636
Fonbola also announced an energy wealth fund opened with a 2 billion pound down payment.

00:05:55.236 --> 00:05:57.496
Rosebank, mostly oil, is a separate call.

